--- !u!114 &352851755
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 352851749}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: fe7a71e0b136aa34eaff7159011ab187, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: '::'
  _text:
  - "Hey - how\u2019s it going? I can see you\u2019re new here. I\u2019ll give you
    a quick run-through."
  - "Let\u2019s start simple: use the arrow keys to move."
  - "Pay attention to this panel - it\u2019s extremely important in the game."
  - You can combine basic elements to create abilities.
  - If you mess up a combination, press C to clear it.
  - Try switching your weapon to the shotgun (press Q twice).
  - Awesome! There are plenty more combinations - discover them as you play!
  - "You may have noticed this bar - it\u2019s the overheat gauge."
  - It fills up after each successful spell.
  - "When it\u2019s full you\u2019ll hear a distinct sound and a QTE will appear
    on the bar."
  - If you hit the QTE, the overheat will drop completely; otherwise it will cool
    down slowly.
  - You perform the QTE by pressing SPACE.
  - Now try to fill the bar and hit the QTE.
  - "Great! You\u2019re picking it up fast!"
  - One last thing - look here.
  - This number shows your remaining lives.
  - "If it falls to zero, you\u2019ll return to the main menu and have to start over."
  - Hope that was clear.
  - "If you\u2019re ready to start, press me and let\u2019s go!"
  _typingWait: 0.07
  _typingEvent:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 352851754}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: AudioComponent, Assembly-CSharp
        m_MethodName: SetAudio
        m_Mode: 5
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
          m_IntArgument: 0
